(text "U1 = LTC2644-L12 dual PWM-to-voltage DAC (read off the chip in your photo).\nPins 1-6 from datasheet listings; pins 7-12 numbering NOT confirmed - check the datasheet.\n12-bit version: PWM input 30 Hz - 6.25 kHz only  ->  use pwmdrv freq = 3 kHz.\nIDLSEL / REFSEL / REF connections UNVERIFIED (nets end in \"?\")." (at 150 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5393cf7d-e80c-407d-b216-fa294e2fdcce))
(text "!! IDLSEL: if tied LOW (chip default \"HI-Z/HOLD\"), an input held low >50-70 ms makes that\noutput HIGH-IMPEDANCE (0% PWM = zero torque -> AASD Vref floats -> 50 Hz hum).\nMeasure U1 pin 4 to GND: 0 V = hi-Z mode, 3.3 V = drives 0 V / full scale." (at 150 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 623c22d7-f371-4545-8173-f7816bda62f4))
