(text "DB25 side labels on PCB: Index, ENC A, EN, DIR, ENC B, 5v, Gnd, Torque, Gnd.\nWhich DB25 pin each goes to is ASSUMED from the AASD manual (CN2):\n Torque->25, Gnd->13/10/1, DIR->7, EN->6, 5v->9, ENC A/B/Index->20/18/15 (single-ended +).\nEN source on the STM32 side not found on the silkscreen (may be tied to GND = always on)." (at 284.48 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 38fdd9e0-a686-4ac3-bc42-67b2d2f6104a))
