(text "THANOS \"TDD Micro\" AASD-SERVO MMOS FFB v2.0  -  RECONSTRUCTED SCHEMATIC (NOT from the manufacturer)" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 3f739d52-6269-4e24-a218-9610b3fb6598))
(text "STM32 pin mapping: derived (see J1 note). Board-internal wiring between the module, U1 jumpers and the DB25\nis inferred from silkscreen - items marked ASSUMED / ? need a continuity check." (at 20.32 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6fa8db85-ce1a-43a3-8fae-3d47076a4882))
(text "OpenFFBoard F407VG_DISCO use of these pins:\n PE9 PWM, PE11 DIR (PWM+DIR mode); PA0/PA1/PA2 encoder A/B/Z; PB0/PB1/PC4 = AIN0/AIN1/AIN2 (brake/gas/clutch);\n PC5 = ADC_VINT in firmware (conflicts with Z sensor); PA4-PA7 SPI1 (shifter); PB12-PB15 SPI2;\n PD12/PD14/PD15 LEDs; PE2-PE5, PC13 = DIN7..DIN4, DIN2 (buttons B3-B6, B14); E-stop PD5 not on this board." (at 20.32 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3f2f9835-5e54-4a19-bee7-99a1c76d0f87))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
